WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Dana (Northwind)>Thanks for joining. Two things today: photos on claims, and the claims list.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Dana (Northwind)>Our adjusters need to filter the claims list by status, so they only see the open ones.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:25.000
<v Sam (team)>I think the API already does that, I'll double check after the call.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
<v Dana (Northwind)>The big one: customers must attach photos of the damage to a claim, up to five per claim.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:40.000
<v Sam (team)>What is the maximum file size per photo?

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:50.000
<v Dana (Northwind)>I don't know, I'll ask our IT people and get back to you.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:45.000
<v Dana (Northwind)>Also, we decided that claims above ten thousand dollars always go to manual review.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:25.000
<v Lee (Northwind)>Careful: the photos may show people's faces, legal will want to know where we store them.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:10.000
<v Dana (Northwind)>I'll send you twenty sample photos by Friday.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:30.000
<v Sam (team)>And we'll send an estimate for the photo upload next week.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:50.000
<v Dana (Northwind)>Great, same time next week then.
